# =====================================================================
# Release V021 -- Audit.usp_Delete_All_Tenant utility
# =====================================================================
# Metadata-driven full purge of one tenant: deletes every row WHERE Tenant_ID = @Tenant_ID
# across EVERY tenant-bearing table in all schemas (Bronze/Silver/Gold data + Audit.Tenants +
# Config/Input/Security per-tenant config/targets/RLS). @Dry_Run=1 previews counts. Refuses
# the -1 sentinel. For test cleanup / tenant offboarding / DSAR erasure.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V021__util_delete_all_tenant.manifest
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Audit.usp_Delete_All_Tenant.StoredProcedure.sql
